# Which ParaBank instance to test.
#   local  -> http://localhost:${PARABANK_PORT} (default; run `npm run env:up` first; isolated, used in CI)
#   public -> https://parabank.parasoft.com (shared data; Cloudflare rate-limits bursts of sign-ups)
ENV=local

# Host port for the local Docker instance (docker-compose.yml). Default: 8090
# PARABANK_PORT=8090

# Optional: point at any other ParaBank deployment. Overrides ENV's URL. Example:
# BASE_URL=https://parabank.example.test
